drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='Very happy with Pie in the Sky.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,287.088\,289.776)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='對天空中的餡餅非常滿意。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,287.088\,289.776)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='I read about this restaurant on a\nblog I follow and since the writer\nsaid the food was fantastic\,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,290.176\,296.128)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='我在我關注的部落格上讀到了關於這家餐廳的信息\n，因為作者說食物很棒，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,290.176\,296.128)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='I thought I\'d check it out.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,296.528\,298.736)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='我想我應該檢查一下。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,296.528\,298.736)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='It\'s a bit of a drive to get to as\nit is located on Mt. Charles\,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,299.136\,304.464)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='由於它位於查爾斯山，所以需要開車一段時間才能\n到達，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,299.136\,304.464)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='but it is well worth the trip.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,304.864\,307.264)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='但這趟旅行非常值得。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,304.864\,307.264)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='There is a large open area in\nfront of the restaurant that is\nperfect for taking pictures of the\nbeautiful mountain scenery and for\nkids to play in.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,307.664\,315.848)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='餐廳前方有一大片空地，非常適合拍攝美麗的山景\n，也適合孩子們玩耍。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,307.664\,315.848)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='After going in\, we were greeted by\na very courteous server who took\nus to our table.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,316.248\,321.624)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='進去後，一位非常有禮貌的服務員迎接了我們，帶\n我們到了我們的桌子。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,316.248\,321.624)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='Unfortunately\, they got the\nseating for our reservation wrong\nbut quickly corrected the mistake.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,322.024\,327.904)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='不幸的是，他們把我們預訂的座位弄錯了，但很快\n就糾正了錯誤。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,322.024\,327.904)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='They even gave us a window seat so\nwe could look out on the mountains\nwhile we ate.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,328.304\,332.984)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='他們甚至給了我們一個靠窗的座位，這樣我們就可\n以一邊吃飯一邊欣賞外面的山景。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,328.304\,332.984)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='The head chef\, who has won several\nawards\, made sure our pizzas were\ncooked perfectly\, especially the\nchicken one my children ordered.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,333.384\,341.784)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='曾經獲得多項獎項的主廚確保我們的披薩烹飪完美\n，尤其是我的孩子們點的雞肉披薩。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,333.384\,341.784)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='The food itself was wonderful.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,342.184\,344.800)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='食物本身很棒。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,342.184\,344.800)',
